  m_text: "int Add(int a, int b)\r\n{\r\n    return a + b;\r\n}\r\n\nThis method
    returns an int, the result of a + b. You can catch that result:\n\nint result
    = Add(5, 3); // result now holds 8\r\n\nNote: once return is cast, the spell
    ends there\u2014it won\u2019t continue beyond it."
