  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Dfferent return types\nJust as potions come in many forms, methods can
    return different types of data:\n\nstring GetHeroName()\r\n{\r\n    returin \"Arcturus
    the Bold\";\r\n}\r\n\r\nbool IsAlive(int health)\r\n{\r\n    return health >
    0;\r\n}\r\n\r\ndouble Multiply(double a, double b)\r\n{\r\n    return a * b;\r\n}\r\n\nThe
    type you declare as the return type must match the type of value your method
    returns. Otherwise, your spell will fizzle (compiler error!)."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0aae22f55f1cf54c8768d2a8854e9ad, type: 2}
