  m_text: "Methods with parameters \u2013 feeding the spell\nYou can pass information
    into your spell using parameters:\n\nvoid GreetAdventurer(string name)\n\r{\r\n   
    Console.WriteLine(\"Welcome, \" + name + \"!\");\r\n}\n\nThen call it like this:\n\nGreetAdventurer(\"Artemis\");\n\nParameters
    allow your method to be dynamic and more powerful."
